<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>G36c Recoil Aid</Major>
    <Description>Following the nerf, the G36c has some crazy mule kick. This mostly removes side to side, and spread should hit heads only within 10 meters without micro adjustments. Would not recommend using this to hold pixel peaks, side to side is too unpredictable, and this macro is semi-random ironically for more consistency in other use cases.

Loadout: Acog, Compensator, Vertical Grip

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 5 30 6 31
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 35
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 35
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 30
Delay 15 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>